                                                                            <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt;Video Container&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Changes the video container in the default output file generated container.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- &lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt;mkv &lt;/span&gt;is &lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt;recomended&lt;/span&gt; due to its extensive support for different formats.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt;WARNING: Changing this &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=" font-weight:700; text-decoration: underline;"&gt;MAY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt; break encoder compadibility. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt;Please look at the audio and video encoder tooltips for compadibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
                                                                           </property>
                                         </widget>
                                        </item>
